<!-- CONVERTED — VISUALLY VERIFIED --><chapter xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude" xml:id="ch07-optimization-related-rates-and-models">
  <title>Optimization, Related Rates, and Models</title>
  <shorttitle>Optimization and Models</shorttitle>

  <introduction><p>Applications of derivatives begin by expressing the relevant quantities as functions. We will build models for related rates, optimization, measurement error, growth, and least-time paths. In each case, interpret the result using the model's domain, assumptions, and units.</p></introduction>

